        row 0 is solid across W cols; row 1 has only the two endpoint cols.
      bottom bracket: flush to bottom row, 2 rows tall, same width W.
        bottom row is solid; row above has only the two endpoint cols.
    interior_width: W-2 (1-2); both brackets share the same interior width
    placement: brackets on horizontally opposite halves; zero column overlap
  mover:
